  "content": "<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\">这个模组让你可以伸手来回抚摸朋友的头。</span></h2><h2><span style=\"color:#fff\">与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/player-ladder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">玩家梯子</a>模组兼容时，会优先触发摸头动作。</span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">摸头模组是<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fplugin%252fheadpat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Headpat a Friend</a>的移植版本</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f2be4026-ad8a-487a-86cd-6c9e0f2a34d9.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"608\" height=\"746\"></span></p>",
